# `*p = <v>` with the operand [d + 1, ti - 1) typed `*Str`, the value just parsed from `ti`: as `_istr_fsc`.
# 6.7.16 (D19, below): and `*pp = <v>` with the operand a `**Str` (`*pp` the `*Str` slot it points at, `_istr_dspp`).
fn _istr_dsto(S, d, ti): i64 {
